      "content": "Guilt can sometimes feel like a necessary step toward comfort, but treatment doesn't mean the noise of nothingness will simply turn into active sadness; it means learning quiet steps to quiet it so you don't have to be so alone with it. You are not walking alone, and even when the outside world feels gray, a professional can be the quiet partner who listens when you feel no one else does. Please trust that seeking this quiet requires enough courage to make the one call that might finally stop the gray from covering your eyes.",
